    "title": "第37课：HIN 和 HER 副词",
    "header_color": "cyan",
    "pages": [
      {
        "page": 1,
        "total_pages": 1,
        "content": [
          "HIN = 远离说话者，HER = 朝向说话者",
          "",
          "基本形式：",
          "hin =（去）那里    her =（来）这里",
          "Wo gehst du hin?（你要去哪儿？）",
          "Komm her!（过来！）",
          "",
          "与副词结合：",
          "hierhin = 到这个地方  hierher = 到我这边",
          "dorthin = 到那里      dorther = 从那里",
          "wohin = 去哪儿        woher = 从哪儿来",
          "",
          "与介词结合：",
          "hinaus/heraus=出去 hinein/herein=进来",
          "hinauf/herauf=上去 hinunter/herunter=下来",
          "口语：rein, raus, rauf, runter（hin/her 通用）",
          "Komm herein!（进来！—朝向说话者）",
          "Geh hinaus!（出去！—远离说话者）"
        ],
        "pronunciation": "Lektion 37"
      }
    ]
  }
]